WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Advertising your business shouldn't mean learning another complicated dashboard.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Meet MAIRO, your AI advertising team. Start with your website, or a few words about your business.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.500
MAIRO reads your website and shows what it found, and where it found it.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
You confirm what matters: your offer, your area, and what you want from your ads.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Then MAIRO builds your free advertising plan: the objective, the audience and the budget.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Every recommendation comes with the reason behind it, and nothing is spent to see it.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Three creative concepts, written for your business, with the one to test first.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Preview them where they'd run, and make the words your own.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Save the concept you want to test first.

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
With a subscription, MAIRO builds the campaign in your own Meta ad account.

11
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Nothing launches, and nothing is spent, until you approve it.

12
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Follow your results in one place: what Meta reports, kept apart from what you confirm.

13
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
And see what MAIRO recommends next, with the figures behind it, waiting for your yes.

14
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Your AI advertising team is ready. Build your free ad plan.
